Comment: 50,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.02,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Intro}
Comment: 50,0:00:05.99,0:00:06.02,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{The Cattle Museum, Part 1}
Dialogue: 50,0:00:05.99,0:00:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Food and Agriculture Museum\Nat the Tokyo University of Agriculture,
Dialogue: 50,0:00:08.99,0:00:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the venue for a collaboration exhibit\Nwith the {\i1}Noble Farmer{\i0} manga in 2022.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:13.83,0:00:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! A life-sized cow standee!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:16.33,0:00:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And look, a cow milker!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:18.34,0:00:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? "Owned by the Cattle Museum"?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.04,0:00:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch your fancy?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.84,0:00:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You snuck up on me!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Introducing the specialized cattle museum\Nin Oshu, Iwate!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:25.98,0:00:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Known as none other than the Cattle Museum!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:28.58,0:00:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So straightforward!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:29.95,0:00:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It used to be known as\NThe Town of Maesawa's Cattle Museum,
Dialogue: 50,0:00:32.95,0:00:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but it changed names after a city merger.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:35.39,0:00:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting! Y'know what Maesawa\Nmakes me think of?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:38.92,0:00:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Maesawa beef!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:40.42,0:00:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, to fill their tummies\Nwith Maesawa beef—
Dialogue: 50,0:00:45.03,0:00:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,rather, to learn more about cattle,
Dialogue: 50,0:00:47.97,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Arakawa and Ishii make their way\Nto the Cattle Museum in Oshu, Iwate.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:59.18,0:01:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's cow decorations all over the place!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:02.25,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me pay the admission...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:03.98,0:01:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoops!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:04.78,0:01:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you dropped some...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:06.38,0:01:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? A membership card\Nfor the Cattle Museum Friendly Club?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:09.52,0:01:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dang, you caught me! Hahaha!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:12.46,0:01:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's a lifetime membership?!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:14.09,0:01:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea you were a regular here!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:16.59,0:01:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dang, it's nothing! Hahaha!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:19.46,0:01:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're our new member, yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.30,0:01:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, it's my first visit, haha.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:22.83,0:01:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're just a newbie after all!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Cattle Museum!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:27.07,0:01:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for having us!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:29.34,0:01:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you grew up on a dairy farm,\Nis that right, Miss Arakawa?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:32.64,0:01:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I conduct research on mastitis in cattle.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:35.55,0:01:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mastitis, you say?!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:37.08,0:01:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There has to be a way to prevent it.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.72,0:01:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's more likely in some than others.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:40.35,0:01:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'd prefer not to use antibiotics.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.42,0:01:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It helps to give them less\Nconcentrated feed.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.26,0:01:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}But then they produce less milk.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:41.32,0:01:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They've connected over\Nstruggles with mastitis.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.79,0:01:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It all sounds like gibberish to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:50.03,0:01:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Noble Farmer"... I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.33,0:01:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Our first floor primarily showcases\Nthe history of Maesawa beef,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.67,0:01:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as the cattle industry as a whole.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.17,0:02:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Maesawa beef cattle {\i1}Kiyogiku-go.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.34,0:02:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What a huge taxidermy!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.84,0:02:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's meat grades\Nand a sample by its feet...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.58,0:02:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This feels surreal.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.58,0:02:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kiyogiku-go{\i0} is at the highest meat grade of A5!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.35,0:02:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Maesawa beef is also very strictly defined.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.35,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Just like Tajima beef!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.52,0:02:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We covered that in Season 2, Head 18: "Cow Trivia"!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.26,0:02:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Another interesting thing about the museum\Nis this section showcasing cattle raisers.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.76,0:02:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, a whole barrage of gorgeous\Ntrophies and certificates!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.93,0:02:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving the people behind cattle beef\Nthe respect they deserve!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.67,0:02:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more interesting is their exhaustive\Nsection on beef cuisine.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.07,0:02:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just looking at it makes me hungry!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.01,0:02:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they show different meals\Nyou can make with each cut of beef!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.71,0:02:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It really shows how much\Nthey care about eating Maesawa beef!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.81,0:02:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Having filled our brains—and emptied our stomachs—\Nwe make our way to the second floor.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.45,0:02:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the handrails look like cows!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.52,0:02:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Our second floor showcases the relations\Nof humans and cattle, and cattle biology.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.99,0:02:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This cow taxidermy is a Scottish Highland.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.26,0:02:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So fluffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.70,0:03:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna feel!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.90,0:03:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologies, but you cannot touch the taxidermies.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.17,0:03:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems like people felt it up\Nwhile we weren't looking,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.77,0:03:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and the fur on its shoulders thinned out.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.91,0:03:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's terrible...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.41,0:03:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The fluff is tempting, but we must resist.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.45,0:03:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you make an exhibit\Nof a Highland fur people {\i1}can{\i0} feel?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.98,0:03:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a guaranteed hit!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.25,0:03:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make it happen!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.49,0:03:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And who's going to clean up the loose furs?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.42,0:03:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stop here, with Arakawa's\Nproposal being swiftly rejected!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.76,0:03:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,See you in part 2!
